## Ingredients

- 1/2 Cup Creamy Peanut Butter 128g x 2
- 2 Tbs rice vinegar 9g x2
- 2 Tbs reduced-sodium tamari or soy sauce - 13g x 2
- 2 Tbs honey 22g x 2
- 1 Tbs toasted sesame oil - 5g x 2
- 2 cloves garlic minced - 6g x 2
- 2 - 3 Tbs water as needed

## Instructions

1. Mix well

## Notes

- **Nutrition:** Per serving of about 1 1/2 Tbs, using the cup and spoon amounts listed (one batch, not doubled).
